## How to Use This Document

### For the agent:
- Work against these questions proactively
- When monitoring or researching, check for updates to these questions
- Propose new questions based on emerging patterns
- Flag when a question is substantially answered

### For humans:
- Add new questions as they arise
- Mark questions resolved when answered
- Reprioritize based on strategic needs

---

## Status Tracking

- [ ] = Open question, actively pursuing
- [x] = Substantially answered (move to archive)
- [~] = Deprioritized (explain why)

